* ICsprout 55LLULP resistor temperature, process, and mismatch equations

.option temp=25

v1 n1 0 .7
a1 n1 0 null null r1
.model r1 icsres (variant=1 l=2u w=1.5u mr=2 resmis_mod=1 flag_cc=1 drsh=.003 ddw=1n dcox=1u dcapsw=2p sigma_mis=.75)
